.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words and characters in a file

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.B int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The wordCount function counts the number of lines, words and characters in the file stream provided by file.

The function stores the results in the variables pointed to by lines, words and chars.

It returns 0 on success and -1 on failure.

